# Working notes, kept on disk and out of the repository.
#
# `docs/status/` is a session diary — hypotheses, A/B runs, non-results and
# withdrawn premises — written for whoever is mid-pass, not for a reader.
# `docs/reviews/` is code-review transcripts. `PLAN.md` is the internal
# milestone plan. The twelve `docs/design/pdfrum-*.md` briefs are porting
# maps keyed to a read-only PDFium checkout: without that checkout they cite
# files nobody can open. What survives in `docs/` is documentation.
